 <a href=\"./Std/Internal/UV/TCP.html#Std.Internal.UV.TCP.Socket\">Socket</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/System/IO.html#IO\">IO</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Enables the Nagle algorithm for a TCP socket.","docLink":"./Std/Internal/UV/TCP.html#Std.Internal.UV.TCP.Socket.noDelay","kind":"opaque","line":148,"name":"Std.Internal.UV.TCP.Socket.noDelay","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Internal/UV/TCP.lean#L148-L152"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Internal/UV/TCP.html#Std.Internal.UV.TCP.Socket.getSockName\"><span class=\"name\">Std</span>.<span class=\"name\">Internal</span>.<span class=\"name\">UV</span>.<span class=\"name\">TCP</span>.<span class=\"name\">Socket</span>.<span class=\"name\">getSockName</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">socket</span> : <a href=\"./Std/Internal/UV/TCP.html#Std.Internal.UV.TCP.Socket\">Socket</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/System/IO.html#IO\">IO</a> <a href=\"./Std/Net/Addr.html#Std.Net.SocketAddress\">Net.SocketAddress</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Gets the local address of a bound TCP socket.","docLink":"./Std/Internal/UV/TCP.html#Std.Internal.UV.TCP.Socket.getSockName","kind":"opaque","line":142,"name":"Std.Internal.UV.TCP.Socket.getSockName","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Std/Internal/UV/TCP.lean#L142-L146"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Std/Internal/UV/TCP.html#Std.Internal.UV.TCP.Socket.getPeerName\">